<title>USA: TABLE- DM Mgmt Q2 oper shr $0.23 vs $0.11.</title>
<headline>TABLE- DM Mgmt Q2 oper shr $0.23 vs $0.11.</headline>
<dateline>HINGHAM, Mass. 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended</p>
<p>			 June 28 1997		June 29 1996</p>
<p> Oper Shr profit	  $0.23   profit	 $0.11</p>
<p> Shr	profit	   0.23     loss	  1.79</p>
<p> Net	profit	  1,205     loss	 8,456</p>
<p> Revs			32,885		   21,582</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   5,150		    4,737</p>
<p>Six months ended</p>
<p> Oper shr profit	  $0.35   profit	 $0.17</p>
<p> Shr	profit	   0.35     loss	  1.77</p>
<p> Net	profit	  1,746     loss	 8,192</p>
<p> Revs			57,428		   41,318</p>
<p> Avg			  5,056		    4,620</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The second quarter of 1996 includes a $9 million charge related to the company's discontinuing its Carroll Reed catalog operations. The company's full name is DM Management Co.</p>
</text>
